\section*{【小问 1 详解】}
解: 依题意可得 $\left\{\begin{array}{l}e=\frac{c}{a}=\frac{1}{2} \\ 4 a=8 \\ c^{2}=a^{2}-b^{2}\end{array}\right.$, 解得 $\left\{\begin{array}{l}a=2 \\ c=1 \\ b=\sqrt{3}\end{array}\right.$,
